{"4669930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Broom Racer", "steam_appid": 4669930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4791220], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broom Racer is a party racing game on flying brooms. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Broom Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broom behaves like a physical object and is capable of reaching a maximum speed of 360 km/h or 220 mph. Flying risky maneuvers on your broom is rewarded with a speed boost. Risky maneuvers include staying as close to the ground/walls/ceiling as possible, flying through tight boost hoops, flying in the slipstream of other players and more. <br>Collisions will throw you off your broom and cost you valuable time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.poster.avif?t=1786550309\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.webm?t=1786550309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.mp4?t=1786550309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race tracks are a mix of procedurally generated and hand crafted maps, featuring high mountains, tunnels, forrests and more. You are free to fly where ever you like, but the race is guided by boost hoops. The tracks often split up into multiple paths. Fiery boost hoops mark the faster but more dangerous paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broom Racer has a living, breathing world and features many dynamic obstacles. Cyclopses live in the mountains and hate being disturbed. High speed trains move through tight tunnels. Don't let them throw you off your broom!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broom Racer is a party racing game on flying brooms. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Broom Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broom behaves like a physical object and is capable of reaching a maximum speed of 360 km/h or 220 mph. Flying risky maneuvers on your broom is rewarded with a speed boost. Risky maneuvers include staying as close to the ground/walls/ceiling as possible, flying through tight boost hoops, flying in the slipstream of other players and more. <br>Collisions will throw you off your broom and cost you valuable time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.poster.avif?t=1786550309\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.webm?t=1786550309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/extras/dd8904d8d00f3cc8d05fb5c68301f762.mp4?t=1786550309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race tracks are a mix of procedurally generated and hand crafted maps, featuring high mountains, tunnels, forrests and more. You are free to fly where ever you like, but the race is guided by boost hoops. The tracks often split up into multiple paths. Fiery boost hoops mark the faster but more dangerous paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broom Racer has a living, breathing world and features many dynamic obstacles. Cyclopses live in the mountains and hate being disturbed. High speed trains move through tight tunnels. Don't let them throw you off your broom!</p>", "short_description": "Broom Racer is a first person, party racing game on flying brooms. Race your friends or player bots through mountains, tight tunnels, forests and more. Evade enemies, pickup items to gain an advantage and fly risky maneuvers to gain a speed boost. Don't fall of your broom!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/a92ee76036b048dc37a2a2b537c5880cac191fae/header.jpg?t=1786550309", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/d7a49b6e8b2cbacf139fa45341b0aba8acabdda0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786550309", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669930/d7a49b6e8b2cbacf139fa45341b0aba8acabdda0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786550309", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ether GmbH"], "publishers": ["Ether GmbH"], "demos": [{"appid": 4791220, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "9", "description